# Traditional Chinese for the Slint app.
# Singapore scheme names (HDB, EC, BSD, ABSD, CPF, MSR) are deliberately
# left in English: they are Singapore statutory schemes with no
# Traditional-market equivalent, so an invented rendering would read as
# official when it is not. Only the surrounding prose is translated.
